==English==
[[File:Domino effect.jpg|thumb|Domino effect]]

===Etymology===
An [[allusion]] to a row of dominoes in which the fall of one leads to a cascade of falling pieces

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The situation in which one [[event]] sets off a [[chain]] of additional events.
# {{lb|en|politics|historical}} The [[theory]] that, if [[South Vietnam]] fell to [[Communism]], it would be followed by [[Cambodia]], [[Laos]], and additional South Asian countries.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|theory of encroaching communism}} {{l|en|domino theory}}

